{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aNatural Selection University\u300b is a challenging strategy simulation game where every decision matters. As a student in a ruthless academic world, your goal is to survive 100 days, manage limited resources, and complete a groundbreaking thesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Carefully plan each day\u2014allocate time between studying, gathering supplies, and resting to maintain health and mental stability. Every choice impacts your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges</strong>: Face sudden events that test your adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited resources\u2014manage your budget to stay afloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor</strong>: Experience a unique blend of absurd humor and serious challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010About Us\u3011</strong><br>Developer: \u5e03\u888b (Budai)<br>Art: Outsourced<br>Music: Music Atelier Amacha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527250/extras/5f75bb872edabbd56713a7e20aee876b.avif?t=1760008528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527250/extras_big/5f75bb872edabbd56713a7e20aee876b.avif?t=1760008528 width=800 height=362 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527250?t=1760008528","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527250?t=1760008528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527250/